{"seq":1,"slug":"codecs-formats","title":"编解码器与封装格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/media-pipeline/codecs-formats","wordCount":1371,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"编解码器与封装格式\">编解码器与封装格式</h1><p>一帧 1080p 的未压缩 RGB 图像约 6MB，每秒 30 帧就是 180MB——没有任何网络能承受。编解码器的存在，就是把这个数字压缩两到三个数量级，同时尽量保住画质。前端做音视频，绕不开「该选哪个编解码器、用什么容器装」这两个问题。本篇建立这套词汇表，后续 <a href=\"adaptive-streaming\">自适应码流与 HLS/DASH</a> 与 <a href=\"../realtime/sfu-mcu-topologies\">SFU、MCU 与多方拓扑</a> 都会用到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>编解码器（codec）压缩的是「码流」（bitstream）——一串编码后的字节；容器（container）则是把码流连同音频、字幕、时间戳打包成一个文件或分片的格式。两者正交：同一份 H.264 码流可以装进 MP4，也可以装进 fMP4 分片用于流媒体。视频压缩的核心思路是去冗余：帧内预测去掉空间冗余，帧间预测（运动估计）去掉时间冗余，于是码流里有了三类帧。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原始视频帧序列] --&gt; B[帧内编码&lt;br/&gt;I 帧 关键帧]&#10;  A --&gt; C[前向预测&lt;br/&gt;P 帧 参考前一帧]&#10;  A --&gt; D[双向预测&lt;br/&gt;B 帧 参考前后帧]&#10;  B --&gt; E[GOP 一组连续帧]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[码流 bitstream]&#10;  F --&gt; G[封装进容器&lt;br/&gt;MP4 / WebM / fMP4]&#10;  G --&gt; H[传输或存储]\">flowchart TD\n  A[原始视频帧序列] --&gt; B[帧内编码&lt;br/&gt;I 帧 关键帧]\n  A --&gt; C[前向预测&lt;br/&gt;P 帧 参考前一帧]\n  A --&gt; D[双向预测&lt;br/&gt;B 帧 参考前后帧]\n  B --&gt; E[GOP 一组连续帧]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[码流 bitstream]\n  F --&gt; G[封装进容器&lt;br/&gt;MP4 / WebM / fMP4]\n  G --&gt; H[传输或存储]</pre><p>下表给出几类关键帧的角色，它们决定了随机访问与抗丢包能力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>帧类型</th>\n<th>参考依赖</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I 帧（关键帧）</td>\n<td>不依赖其他帧</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>GOP 起点，可独立解码、随机访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P 帧</td>\n<td>依赖前面的帧</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>压缩率高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B 帧</td>\n<td>依赖前后帧</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>压缩率最高，但增加延迟，实时少用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"主流视频编解码器的取舍\">主流视频编解码器的取舍</h2><p>选编解码器本质是在压缩率、硬件支持、专利风险三者间权衡。H.264（AVC）是事实标准：硬件编解码无处不在、兼容性最好，代价是压缩率落后于新一代。VP8/VP9 由 Google 推动、免专利费，VP9 压缩率接近 HEVC 且在 WebRTC 里有 SVC 支持。AV1 是开放联盟 AOMedia 的新一代编解码器，压缩率最高，2026 年桌面 Chrome/Edge/Firefox 的 AV1 解码已近乎普及，编码也在约 88% 的会话中可用（需正确的 codec string、Profile 0、8-bit）。</p>\n<p>下表对比 2026 年四大视频编解码器的现状：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编解码器</th>\n<th>相对压缩率</th>\n<th>硬件支持</th>\n<th>专利/授权</th>\n<th>WebRTC 适用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>H.264 / AVC</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>极广</td>\n<td>需授权（多已覆盖）</td>\n<td>默认安全选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VP9</td>\n<td>优于 H.264 约 30%</td>\n<td>较广</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n<td>支持 SVC，画质好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AV1</td>\n<td>优于 VP9 约 30%</td>\n<td>渐增（Safari 限硬件）</td>\n<td>免费但有诉讼风险</td>\n<td>低码率优势大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>H.265 / HEVC</td>\n<td>优于 H.264 约 40%</td>\n<td>广</td>\n<td>授权复杂</td>\n<td>浏览器支持碎片化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>值得注意的是 2026 年 3 月 Dolby 对 Snap 就 HEVC 与 AV1 编码发起的专利诉讼，给「AV1 完全免专利」的叙事蒙上不确定性（来源：WebRTC.ventures, 2026-04）。这不意味着 AV1 不能用，但提醒在大规模商用前评估法律风险。Safari 的 AV1 仍依赖硬件——仅 iPhone 15 Pro、M3 Mac 及更新设备支持，因此跨端方案常以 H.264 为兜底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容器格式与码流的区别\">容器格式与码流的区别</h2><p>把「编解码器」和「容器」混为一谈是常见误区。容器不关心像素怎么压，它关心如何把多条轨道、时间戳、元数据组织在一起。MP4（ISO BMFF）通用且点播友好，但传统 MP4 的 <code>moov</code> 原子（索引）默认在文件末尾，不利于边下边播。WebM 基于 Matroska，天然搭配 VP9/AV1 与 Opus，是 Web 上的开放容器。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 用 MediaCapabilities 在选码前先问浏览器能否高效解码&#10;const support = await navigator.mediaCapabilities.decodingInfo({&#10;  type: &#39;media-source&#39;,&#10;  video: {&#10;    contentType: &#39;video/mp4; codecs=&quot;av01.0.05M.08&quot;&#39;, // AV1 Profile 0&#10;    width: 1920,&#10;    height: 1080,&#10;    bitrate: 4_000_000,&#10;    framerate: 30,&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;// support.supported / smooth / powerEfficient\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用 MediaCapabilities 在选码前先问浏览器能否高效解码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> support</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.mediaCapabilities.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">decodingInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'media-source'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  video: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    contentType: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'video/mp4; codecs=\"av01.0.05M.08\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// AV1 Profile 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    width: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1920</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    height: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1080</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bitrate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    framerate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// support.supported / smooth / powerEfficient</span></span></code></pre></div><p>流媒体场景的关键容器是 fMP4（fragmented MP4）：它把媒体切成一段段独立的 fragment，每段自带 <code>moof+mdat</code>，可以单独请求、单独解码。这正是 CMAF 的基础——用一套 fMP4 分片同时服务 HLS 与 DASH，这部分在 <a href=\"adaptive-streaming\">自适应码流与 HLS/DASH</a> 详述。播放器把这些分片喂给浏览器的方式，则由 <a href=\"media-source-playback\">MSE、EME 与播放器</a> 负责。</p>\n<h2 id=\"音频编解码器与码率估算\">音频编解码器与码率估算</h2><p>视频之外，音频编解码器同样关键。Opus 是 Web 实时音频的王者：从 6kbps 的语音到 510kbps 的音乐自适应、低延迟、免费，WebRTC 默认音频编解码器就是它。AAC 在点播与广播中更常见，兼容性广。选码率时有个直觉公式可用：目标文件大小（字节）约等于码率乘以时长再除以 8。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>size</mtext><mtext>bytes</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mtext>bitrate</mtext><mtext>bps</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>duration</mtext><mtext>s</mtext></msub></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{size}_{\\text{bytes}} \\approx \\frac{\\text{bitrate}_{\\text{bps}} \\times \\text{duration}_{\\text{s}}}{8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.954em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">size</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bytes</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bitrate</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bps</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">duration</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如以 2.5 Mbps 编码一段 600 秒的视频，预计约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>600</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>187</mn><mtext>MB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.5 \\times 10^6 \\times 600 / 8 \\approx 187\\text{MB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600/8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">187</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MB</span></span></span></span></span></span>。这个估算在做 ABR 多档码率规划、TURN 中继带宽预算时都用得上。下表给出常见场景的经验码率，仅作起点，实际需按内容复杂度调整：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>分辨率</th>\n<th>视频码率（经验）</th>\n<th>音频码率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>视频通话</td>\n<td>720p</td>\n<td>1–1.5 Mbps</td>\n<td>32–40 kbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标清直播</td>\n<td>480p</td>\n<td>0.8–1.2 Mbps</td>\n<td>64 kbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高清点播</td>\n<td>1080p</td>\n<td>4–6 Mbps</td>\n<td>128 kbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音乐流</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>128–256 kbps</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>编解码器压缩码流，容器封装码流与轨道；两者正交，同一码流可装进不同容器。</li>\n<li>视频压缩靠 I/P/B 帧去除空间与时间冗余；I 帧（关键帧）是 GOP 起点与随机访问/抗丢包的关键。</li>\n<li>2026 年选码是压缩率、硬件、专利的三方权衡：H.264 兜底、VP9 均衡、AV1 低码率最优但有诉讼隐忧、HEVC 浏览器碎片化。</li>\n<li>fMP4 是流媒体容器基础，CMAF 据此一套分片服务两种协议。</li>\n<li>用 <code>MediaCapabilities.decodingInfo</code> 在选码前探测浏览器能否流畅、省电地解码。</li>\n<li>码率估算公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>size</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mtext>bitrate</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{size} \\approx \\text{bitrate} \\times t / 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">size</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bitrate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">/8</span></span></span></span></span> 贯穿 ABR 规划与带宽预算；下一步见 <a href=\"adaptive-streaming\">自适应码流与 HLS/DASH</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"编解码器与封装格式","id":"编解码器与封装格式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"主流视频编解码器的取舍","id":"主流视频编解码器的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"容器格式与码流的区别","id":"容器格式与码流的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"音频编解码器与码率估算","id":"音频编解码器与码率估算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"信令、ICE、STUN 与 TURN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/foundations/signaling-ice"},"next":{"title":"自适应码流与 HLS/DASH","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/media-pipeline/adaptive-streaming"}}